# Cursor project rules for this workspace

- This repository documents a DevOps lab: GitLab, Runner, K3s, ArgoCD, Traefik, cert-manager, Cloudflare.
- Documentation lives in `docs/` — one chapter per file (`NN-kebab-title.md`).
- Keep edits concise, practical, and focused on Linux/Ubuntu 24.04 commands.
- Preserve existing Markdown structure in each chapter (Overview, Prerequisites, Goals, Steps, Verify, Next).
- Prefer copy-pasteable commands over abstract explanations; use `<PLACEHOLDER>` for environment-specific values.
- Never commit secrets, tokens, or real passwords.
- When adding content, update chapter status in `docs/README.md`.
- Follow conventions in [WORKING.md](./WORKING.md).
- Target audience: single MiniPC lab scaling to multi-node; Digi ISP + Cloudflare DNS assumed unless chapter says otherwise.
